text: ['All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)\\nBituminous Blast deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Deathtouch, lifelink\\nWhen Wurmcoil Engine dies, create a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Wurm artifact creature token with deathtouch and a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Wurm artifact creature token with lifelink.', 'Exile target black or red permanent.', 'Kicker {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell.)\\nBurst Lightning deals 2 damage to any target. If this spell was kicked, it deals 4 damage instead.', 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Multikicker {1} (You may pay an additional {1} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose any target, then choose another target for each time this spell was kicked. Comet Storm deals X damage to each of them.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sun Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may return target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.']
flavor: ['A blazing sun that never sets.']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Izzy', 'Jim Pavelec', 'Jung Park', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Nils Hamm', 'Pete Venters', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Véronique Meignaud']
